@startuml
title VerticalSliceApi - Component Architecture
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "API client" as ApiClient

package "ASP.NET Core host" {
  component "Program.cs\n(composition root)" as Program
  component "HTTP exception handler\n(ValidationException -> 400)" as ErrorHandler
  component "OpenAPI + Scalar\n(Development only)" as ApiDocs
}

interface IEndpoint

package "Student feature slices" {
  component "GetStudents.Endpoint\nGET /api/students" as GetStudentsEndpoint
  component "CreateStudent.Endpoint\nPOST /api/students" as CreateStudentEndpoint
  component "EnrollStudent.Endpoint\nPOST /api/students/{studentId:int}/courses/{courseId:int}" as EnrollStudentEndpoint
}

package "Course feature slices" {
  component "GetCourses.Endpoint\nGET /api/courses" as GetCoursesEndpoint
  component "CreateCourse.Endpoint\nPOST /api/courses" as CreateCourseEndpoint
}

interface ISender
component "MediatR" as Mediator
component "ValidationBehavior\n(open IPipelineBehavior)" as ValidationBehavior
component "CreateStudent.Validator" as CreateStudentValidator
component "CreateCourse.Validator" as CreateCourseValidator

package "Feature handlers" {
  component "GetStudents.Handler" as GetStudentsHandler
  component "CreateStudent.Handler" as CreateStudentHandler
  component "EnrollStudent.Handler" as EnrollStudentHandler
  component "GetCourses.Handler" as GetCoursesHandler
  component "CreateCourse.Handler" as CreateCourseHandler
}

package "Persistence" {
	component "SchoolDbContext" as SchoolDbContext
  component "EF Core DbContext" as EfDbContext
  component "DbSeeder\nSeedAsync(DbContext)" as DbSeeder
  database "SQL Server" as SqlServer
}

Program ..> IEndpoint : scans assembly and registers implementations
IEndpoint <|.. GetStudentsEndpoint
IEndpoint <|.. CreateStudentEndpoint
IEndpoint <|.. EnrollStudentEndpoint
IEndpoint <|.. GetCoursesEndpoint
IEndpoint <|.. CreateCourseEndpoint

Program --> GetStudentsEndpoint : resolves and maps
Program --> CreateStudentEndpoint : resolves and maps
Program --> EnrollStudentEndpoint : resolves and maps
Program --> GetCoursesEndpoint : resolves and maps
Program --> CreateCourseEndpoint : resolves and maps
Program --> ErrorHandler : registers middleware
Program --> ApiDocs : maps in Development
Program --> SchoolDbContext : AddDbContext / UseSqlServer
Program ..> DbSeeder : UseAsyncSeeding callback

ApiClient --> GetStudentsEndpoint
ApiClient --> CreateStudentEndpoint
ApiClient --> EnrollStudentEndpoint
ApiClient --> GetCoursesEndpoint
ApiClient --> CreateCourseEndpoint

GetStudentsEndpoint ..> ISender : Send(Query)
CreateStudentEndpoint ..> ISender : Send(Command)
EnrollStudentEndpoint ..> ISender : Send(Command)
GetCoursesEndpoint ..> ISender : Send(Query)
CreateCourseEndpoint ..> ISender : Send(Command)

ISender <|.. Mediator
Mediator --> ValidationBehavior : request pipeline
ValidationBehavior ..> CreateStudentValidator : validates when registered
ValidationBehavior ..> CreateCourseValidator : validates when registered
ValidationBehavior --> GetStudentsHandler : next()
ValidationBehavior --> CreateStudentHandler : next()
ValidationBehavior --> EnrollStudentHandler : next()
ValidationBehavior --> GetCoursesHandler : next()
ValidationBehavior --> CreateCourseHandler : next()
ValidationBehavior ..> ErrorHandler : throws ValidationException

GetStudentsHandler --> SchoolDbContext : query
CreateStudentHandler --> SchoolDbContext : add + save
EnrollStudentHandler --> SchoolDbContext : load + update + save
GetCoursesHandler --> SchoolDbContext : query
CreateCourseHandler --> SchoolDbContext : add + save
SchoolDbContext --|> EfDbContext
SchoolDbContext --> SqlServer : EF Core provider
DbSeeder ..> EfDbContext : callback receives context
ErrorHandler --> ApiClient : HTTP 400 with validation errors

note right of ValidationBehavior
  Validators are registered from the assembly.
  CreateStudent and CreateCourse have validators;
  requests without validators continue directly.
end note

note right of SchoolDbContext
  Program applies migrations at startup
  only in the Development environment.
end note
@enduml
